  "description": "“When I first moved to Austin there was a large number of students commuting around town on BMX cruisers like the Taj. It was unusual to see, but made perfect sense. BMX bikes are so easy to keep going that even a neglectful college student could do it. Plus, they’re easy and fun to ride. When we started working on a bike with my name on it this was a big inspiration to me. Let’s marry together all the proven, durable, simplicity that is a BMX bike with a frame size that you can actually sit down and pedal. Think of it as a bulletproof, easy-to-use cruiser that can also handle some real BMX action.” -Taj Mihelich\n\nAvailable in Candy Blue only. Also as a Frame+Fork kit.",
